{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>無論你是學生備考、學習語言，還是想掌握專業領域知識，CogniCards 都能透過間隔重複與主動回憶機制，幫你在最短時間內記住更多內容。這款原價 US $4.99 的 App 目前正在限時免費，正是入手的好時機。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能</h2>\n<p>CogniCards 採用現代 FSRS 演算法，自動為每張卡片安排最適複習時機，讓你專注於即將遺忘的內容。支援 Markdown 格式，可加入圖片、表格、程式碼與 LaTeX 數學公式，並提供測驗與配對遊戲等多種練習模式。此外，你還能匯入來自其他閃卡 App 的 .apkg 與文字檔案，無痛轉移既有學習資料。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-136-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-137-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-138-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-139-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-140-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-141-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CogniCards: Cards Reimagined</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T22:43:01.028508+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}